    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to present Apartment 116, Cedar Square to the Swords property market. Ideally located within the highly sought-after Ridgewood development, this lovely two-bedroom second-floor (top floor) apartment presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a stylish, low-maintenance home in a well-established setting.Occupying a desirable corner position, Apartment 116 enjoys the added benefit of having no apartment above, offering enhanced privacy and a peaceful living environment. Bright and beautifully presented throughout, the generous open-plan living and dining area is flooded with natural light, creating a warm and inviting space ideal for both relaxing and entertaining. The adjoining kitchen is well-appointed, providing ample storage and preparation space, while two spacious double bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom complete the well-designed accommodation.\n\nA standout feature of the apartment is the south-facing private balcony, which overlooks the beautifully maintained communal green and children`s playground, creating the perfect space to relax and enjoy sunshine throughout the day. Further enhancing its appeal, the property benefits from a large attic storage space, easily accessed via a convenient pull-down Stira ladder, providing exceptional additional storage rarely found in apartments.\n\nRidgewood offers an excellent range of amenities on your doorstep, including a Tesco Express, pharmacy, medical centre, and crche. The nearby Pavilions Shopping Centre, Swords and Airside Retail Park are all within easy reach, providing an extensive selection of shops, cafs, restaurants, leisure facilities, and entertainment options.\n\nThe area is exceptionally well served by a choice of primary and secondary schools, making it an ideal location for families. Excellent transport links include frequent bus services just a short stroll away, including the Swords Express, which provides a journey time of approximately 15 minutes to Dublin City Centre. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport, and the wider Dublin region are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nEntrance Hallway\n5.05m x 4.00m - Bright entrance hall with wood effect flooring\n\nKitchen\n3.49m x 2.84m - Fitted kitchen with tiled flooring and surround\n\nDining Area\n1.72m x 3.32m - Bright area with wood effect flooring\n\nLiving Room\n3.49m x 4.02m - Large bright living room with wood effect flooring and access to south facing balcony\n\nMaster Bedroom\n4.45m x 3.11m - Large double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and wood effect flooring. Access to balcony.\n\nEn-Suite\n1.53m x 2.26m - Beautiful en-suite with wc, whb and walk in shower. Tiled flooring and surrounds. Window for ventilation.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.25m x 3.03m - Large double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and wood effect flooring.\n\nFamily Bathroom\n2.07m x 1.84m - Wc, Whb and bath with shower attachment. Tiled flooring and surrounds.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
